<TITLE>CVT Fluid Warmer</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>A CVT fluid warmer is provided instead of the common CVT fluid cooler built into the radiator.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The CVT fluid warmer speeds up warm-up of the CVT fluid when the engine is started and functions as an oil cooler during normal driving.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
